          "Text": "Sydney names: \u0027the Harbour Bridge\u0027, \u0027the Harbour Tunnel\u0027, \u0027the M4\u0027, \u0027the M5\u0027, \u0027WestConnex\u0027, \u0027the Warringah Freeway\u0027, \u0027the Eastern Distributor\u0027, \u0027the Anzac Bridge\u0027.",
